Function build_prompt_package:
- assemble shared prompts plus run-specific prompts for four modes: tool planning, stream preview, final JSON generation, and repair
- inject only useful context blocks: match overview, context bundle, task-specific fields, baseline, calibration, reference summary, session memory, tool facts, and localization mappings
- include compare_builds build-B runes and tool-derived slugs so prompts stay aligned with the documented workflow
- keep output-language and localization rules explicit while avoiding raw JSON dumps of backend objects
